# Résumé originals have a phone number in them. Only the cleaned PDF in public/ is published.
# Everything dropped into content/resume/ stays on this computer, whatever its format.
content/resume/*
!content/resume/README.md
*.docx
*.doc
*.odt
*.rtf
public/resume/*.partial

# The LinkedIn download holds personal data (address, birth date, contacts, phone numbers).
# Everything dropped into content/linkedin/ stays on this computer, whatever its format.
content/linkedin/*
!content/linkedin/README.md
*.zip
